{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17666","headline":"春日朝罢呈台中寮友 · 羊士谔","name":"春日朝罢呈台中寮友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退食鵷行振羽仪，九霄双阙迥参差。\n云披彩仗春风度，日暖香堦昼刻移。\n玉树笼烟鳷鹊观，石渠流水凤凰池。\n时清执法惭无事，未有长杨汉主知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}